			"Message": "chore(Cocoon): Regenerate build artifacts and update route manifest timestamp\n\nRebuild all ESBuild output artifacts in the `Target/` directory following source code adjustments in the extension host service layer. Update `Source/Generated/RouteManifest.ts` to reflect the new compilation timestamp, maintaining the set of known Mountain RPC method handlers.\n\nThis commit captures the binary output changes resulting from previous functional updates, ensuring the `Main.js` bootstrap and all service handlers are in sync with the latest source state. All TypeScript type definitions and mapping logic remain consistent with the established IPC contract.",
